WEBVTT

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:05.230
Satoshi, who aims to battle
the Supreme Monarch, Dande...

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:10.240
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew...

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.530
This is the story of
their lives and adventures.

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:22.830
Eefee and Blacky...

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:29.100
Eefee. Sun Pokémon.
Psychic type.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:33.230
Psychic power builds up in the orb on its forehead
as it bathes in the sunshine.

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:36.520
It is extremely loyal to any trainer
it considers to be worthy.

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:42.130
It is said that this Pokémon developed precognitive powers
to protect its trainer from harm.

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:45.570
Blacky. Moonlight Pokémon.
Evil type.

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:51.990
It is nocturnal, and even in total darkness,
its large eyes can spot its prey clearly.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:58.280
When exposed to the moon’s aura, the rings on its body
glow faintly and it gains a mysterious power.

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:04.000
Eevee’s really interested.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.450
Next, have a look at this.

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:08.420
A castle?

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:10.430
It’s called Eclipse Castle.

00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:18.120
Eclipse Castle’s in Johto, and they’ve cherished
Eefee and Blacky as special creatures for eons.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:20.760
I’d like to meet Eefee and Blacky!

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:23.450
How about you, Eevee?

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:27.270
Of course! You wouldn’t pass up
a chance to meet your evolutions.

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:29.520
I thought you might say that.

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:34.110
They’re actually about to hold
a festival for the upcoming total eclipse.

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:35.360
A festival?

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:36.820
Sounds fun, right?

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:38.280
Go and have fun.

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:39.620
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:25.500
So this is Eclipse Castle...

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:28.200
It’s pretty impressive
when you see it up close.

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:31.910
Look!
The crest is Eefee and Blacky!

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:34.020
That’s so cool!

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:46.280
But why is it Eefee and Blacky?

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:48.920
I wonder if there’s some history to it...

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:53.550
You would be right.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:57.490
Once upon a time,
long, long ago,

00:03:57.490 --> 00:03:59.650
in the midst of
the Eclipse Festival,

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:04.380
the lord of the castle was attacked
by someone plottin’ to take over the castle.

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:09.710
But his partners, Eefee and Blacky,
were able to save him.

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:15.870
He made that crest
to celebrate their bravery.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:23.150
It tells of the day of the eclipse,
when the sun and moon become one.

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:25.250
You know a lot about it!

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:27.780
Of course.

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:30.340
I’m the present lord
of the castle, you see.

00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:31.280
What?!

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:34.620
Well, I’ll be steppin’ down
from that position today, though.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.290
Stepping down...?

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:39.710
Huh?

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.670
Where’s Koharu and Eevee?

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:45.140
Where are you going, Eevee?

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:52.360
O Sun, please give
us your protection.

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:56.170
Please let the Eclipse Festival
run smoothly.

00:04:56.170 --> 00:05:01.620
And, please let me be accepted
by everyone as the new castle lord...

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:14.330
Eevee! Stop!

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:31.080
Eevee!

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:34.400
I’m glad you’re safe...

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:37.160
It’s all thanks to
Eefee seein’ the future.

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:38.860
Thank you for savin–

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:39.860
Huh?

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:43.620
Who are you...?

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:46.800
I’m Koharu.

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:49.120
Name’s Haruhi.

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:51.200
Haru...hi?

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:56.100
Koharu? Wow, it’s not even just our faces,
even our names are so similar.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:06:00.630
We came here to see
Eclipse Castle’s Eefee and Blacky.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:02.730
Aw, that makes me happy.

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:04.630
All this way,
just to see us?

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:05.590
Huh?

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:09.050
I had this good idea.

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:14.310
What a shock...

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:16.810
That goes way past being lookalikes!

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:18.440
They’re like twins!

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:21.270
This is like somethin’
from a dream.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:23.950
She really looks just like Haruhi...

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:27.110
Naturally, gran. I’m Haruhi, see?

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:30.320
See? They really
did get us mixed up.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:32.070
Do we really look
that much alike?

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.700
You swapped your clothes...?

00:06:34.110 --> 00:06:39.160
Meetin’ Koharu on this important day,
the day I might become the new castle lord,

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:43.090
this is like a true
fateful encounter.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:47.340
She copies her evolutions’ moves?

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.700
That’s a real mysterious Eevee.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:53.640
Still, despite copying them,
she doesn’t evolve.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:59.980
Eevee have unstable genes in general, but they said
that maybe her genes are more unstable than most.

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.130
Interesting...

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:04.090
And with her being like that...

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:08.910
That’s exactly why I want to
let her choose her own path herself.

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:11.690
And so we’re learning
about lots of things together.

00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:13.010
I really get it!

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:15.560
You think just like I do!

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:21.130
These two, they evolved into Eefee
and Blacky on their own.

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:22.540
Really?

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:23.590
For Eefee...

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:26.210
One, two, three, four!

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:34.230
Thanks...

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:39.710
She was really loyal to me,
even as an Eevee.

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:42.480
That’s gotta be
why she evolved into Eefee.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.860
And that very night...

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:47.030
One, two, three, four!

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:04.130
The other Eevee, I think he evolved
to Blacky to protect the Eefee he loved.

00:08:04.570 --> 00:08:08.130
Eefee, who’s strong in the day.
Blacky, who’s strong at night.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:14.260
The pair of them make up for each other’s flaws,
and support each other.

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:16.510
Make up for each other’s flaws...

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.010
And support each other...

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:22.520
And humans and humans,
or humans and Pokémon can do the same.

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:26.540
Nobody in the whole world’s
perfect all by their own.

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:29.890
But by making up for each other’s flaws,
and supporting each other,

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:33.150
everybody gets to live life
a little easier.

00:08:33.730 --> 00:08:38.580
That’s what I feel,
seein’ how Eefee and Blacky are.

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:40.580
Haruhi...

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:42.420
Wow!

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:44.810
You really <i>are</i> the new
lord of Eclipse Castle!

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:47.800
That’s such a deep
and grand idea!

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:49.300
Th-Thanks...

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:53.200
But if the festival today
doesn’t go off without a hitch,

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:56.370
nobody’s gonna
accept me as lord.

00:08:56.370 --> 00:09:00.180
It’ll be fine!
Everyone’ll accept you, I know they will!

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:09.230
I got somethin’
I wanna show you.

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:23.630
The guy giving the speech
is Hisashi, the lord.

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:28.630
This painting’s supposed to show a scene
from just before he was attacked.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:33.510
He got attacked by...
His younger brother, Tsukiya.

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:37.690
His brother tried to dethrone him...?

00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:39.390
A sad tale, right?

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:44.980
If I’m the lord, I’m gonna make sure
somethin’ like that never happens again.

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:51.570
Oh, there’s the sign
the festival’s starting.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.170
I gotta get ready.

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:55.490
All right! We’ll cheer you on!

00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:57.740
That’s great!

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:02.240
The day is finally here.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:06.000
This long humiliation will end today.

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:12.210
Oh, my clothes!

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:14.780
I never changed back!

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.560
Satoshi and Go,
you go on ahead.

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:17.990
S-Sure.

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:22.810
Ariados! String Shot!

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:32.570
That went well.

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:35.000
What are you doing?!

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:37.470
You stay quiet, Haruhi.

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:42.990
H-Hey!

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:47.210
Eevee!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:49.320
Yorunozuku, to me!

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:00.310
Pocket Monsters!

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:25.580
This is finally it,
Eefee and Blacky.

00:11:30.650 --> 00:11:32.170
Koharu’s taking her time...

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.400
Yeah...

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:35.950
Pikachu?

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:38.210
Eevee?

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:45.460
Something might’ve
happened to Koharu!

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:13.630
Haruhi is in danger...

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:14.880
Haruhi...

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:22.510
What’s going on?!

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:25.930
Air Slash!

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.310
How did you get away?!

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:38.070
Get away?
Whatcha talkin’ about?

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:40.650
What am I talking about?

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:42.570
So she used a double...

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:44.090
A double?

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:46.010
Koharu...?

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:47.410
What did you do to Koharu?!

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:50.290
Or were they twins?

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:51.660
Where’s Koharu?!

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:57.090
If you want her back,
declare me the new lord of the castle!

00:12:58.310 --> 00:12:59.710
Who would you be?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.310
Stay back, gran.

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:03.420
Koharu...

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:05.930
Stop, Blacky.

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:08.700
Don’t do anything
until I give the word.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:12.780
What happened?

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:14.690
Somethin’ goin’ on up there?

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:20.440
Koharu!

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:31.870
Koharu!

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:55.560
Hey!

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:58.690
She figured out where Koharu is!

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:09.720
Say it! The next castle lord
will not be you, but me!

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:12.270
So Koharu will be okay?

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:14.840
If you follow my commands.

00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:16.830
Hey, what’s your name?

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:18.080
What does that matter?!

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:21.840
She can’t give you lordship
if she doesn’t even know your name.

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:26.970
It’s Katsuki.

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:29.490
Katsuki...

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:30.860
Say it, then!

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:36.980
Haruhi!

00:14:38.530 --> 00:14:39.600
Koharu?

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:45.440
<i>Haruhi! Are you okay?!</i>

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:49.200
Come on out!

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:55.100
Let’s go, Pikachu!

00:14:55.630 --> 00:14:58.240
Sarunori, we have to
save Koharu and Haruhi!

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:00.870
Hold it, Satoshi, Go.

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:04.170
Do you mind
leavin’ this to us?

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:06.260
But...

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:10.300
This’s an important moment,
that’s gonna decide if I become the lord.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:12.340
<i>I</i> will become the lord!

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:16.640
How about ya stop yellin’
and we talk, okay?

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:19.670
Talk? Don’t mock me!

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:21.410
Ariados! Poison Jab!

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:23.210
Yorunozuku! Wing Attack!

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:24.860
Ringuma! Arm Hammer!

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:29.200
No helpin’ it... Eefee, Reflector!

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:31.150
Blacky! Bark Out!

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:41.920
Ariados! String Shot!

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:46.550
Eevee, dodge it and Tackle!

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:55.470
Now! Needle Missiles!

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:57.870
Eefee, use Reflector again...

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:08.150
So, that’s her mysterious power?

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:11.240
Understood, Eevee! Reflector!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:20.030
Thanks, Eevee!

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:21.950
Eefee! Wish!

00:16:22.820 --> 00:16:24.840
Blacky! Evil Pulse!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:27.830
Yorunozuku! Air Slash!

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:29.000
Ringuma! Slash!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:55.700
Eefee’s Wish healed Blacky!

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:59.320
Just like Haruhi said,
they’re supporting each other!

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:04.140
The total eclipse is beginning!

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:06.730
Big chance comin’!

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:08.020
A big chance?

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:09.210
Yeah.

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:14.680
Eefee powers up in sunlight,
and Blacky in moonlight.

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:17.930
So a total eclipse, when the sun
and moon become one...

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:22.020
That’s a once in a lifetime chance
for them both to be stronger!

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.520
I won’t let that happen!

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:25.650
Ariados! Needle Missiles!

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:27.270
Yorunozuku! Air Slash!

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:28.900
Ringuma! Arm Hammer!

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.170
Eevee!

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:35.270
Oh, this time you’re
going to copy Blacky’s move?

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.460
Eevee! Evil Pulse!

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:58.160
Eefee! Psychokinesis!

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:00.220
Blacky! Evil Pulse!

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:18.740
You did it!

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:22.490
Ringuma! Yorunozuku!
Ariados...

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:37.260
Katsuki.

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:41.890
My gran’s been lookin’
for ya for years.

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:43.140
Huh?

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:48.620
This castle used to have a tradition of puttin’ the sun
and moon in people’s names.

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:51.880
The “hi”
in Haruhi means the sun.

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:54.360
Hisashi, the lord,
had a “hi” too.

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:57.230
His brother was called Tsukiya.

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:02.530
And you’ve got “tsuki,”
moon, in your name too.

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:05.900
Because you’re descended
from him, right?

00:19:07.050 --> 00:19:08.530
Yeah, that’s right!

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:13.680
My ancestor was ashamed of his
failed attempt at becoming the lord!

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:16.170
We’ve lived in secret
for so long!

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:19.280
I got fed up
with living like that.

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:22.810
I decided that I was gonna be
the Eclipse Castle lord, someday!

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:24.900
We’ve finally found you!

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:29.960
I had managed to discover
there was a child named Katsuki...

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:32.100
But please forgive me.

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.320
If only we’d found you sooner,

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:37.690
you wouldn’t have had to
endure so much hardship.

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:39.770
What are you talking about...?

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:46.300
Everybody!

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:50.870
I got an important announcement
to make, so listen up!

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:53.130
H-Hey! What are you doing?!

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:57.340
From today, I’m going to be
the new lord of Eclipse Castle!

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:04.480
And Katsuki here says
he’ll be helpin’ me along,

00:20:04.480 --> 00:20:08.100
so I hope you will show us
kindness despite our youth!

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:10.950
I never asked for this!

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:12.530
Well, what’s that matter?

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:17.550
Besides, if you go <i>all</i> the way back,
we’re basically siblings.

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:19.910
I don’t need your pity.

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:21.070
This ain’t pity!

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:28.910
Me and gran, we’ve been waitin’ for ages
for our missing “moon” to return.

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:36.420
Think about how Eefee
and Blacky work together,

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:40.110
making up for each other’s flaws,
and supporting each other.

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:41.930
I think that’s
the best way to live.

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:44.930
Even Eclipse Castle...

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:47.650
The sun and the moon,
day and night...

00:20:47.650 --> 00:20:53.690
It takes both of ‘em working together
to create a peaceful world.

00:20:54.280 --> 00:20:57.190
Squabbling’ll never get us anywhere.

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:00.940
No point staying
bound to the past.

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:03.450
We’ve gotta change
what we can change!

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:06.950
Else we can’t move forward, right?

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:17.500
Let’s be good friends, Katsuki!

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:18.710
Ow!

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:32.460
Eefee, Blacky, and Haruhi taught Eevee
and Koharu an important lesson.

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:38.780
What sort of future— of <i>evolution</i>—
could they have in store?

00:23:07.170 --> 00:23:09.580
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.580 --> 00:23:11.120
Go!

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:14.740
My first trial mission
from Project Mew is here!

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:15.910
So? What’s it say?

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:18.990
“Gather the golden scales
of Ulgamoth!”

00:23:18.990 --> 00:23:20.010
Eggs!

00:23:20.010 --> 00:23:22.880
These are probably Melarva eggs.

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:26.710
Melarva will hatch from them,
and evolve into Ulgamoth.

00:23:26.710 --> 00:23:29.760
Hey, he’s finally doing
his first trial mission.

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:31.390
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:31.390 --> 00:23:35.430
A Trial Mission!
Ulgamoth’s Golden Scales!!
